{
  "_comment": "Host/URL pattern → class + role. The classification engine of the detector; grow it per site by adding rows, never by editing detector code. Classes: T tag/consent · F form · V media · S search · A API/experimentation · X auth · D data · - utility (not dynamic). Martech rows also carry `id` + consent `category` (necessary · analytics · marketing · personalization · functional) for martech.mjs; the first matching row wins, so specific rows precede host-wide ones. Product names only — never a customer's own hosts or account ids.",
